sequenceDiagram
    participant B as "Browser"
    participant API as ".NET 10 API"
    participant MSID as "MS Identity"
    participant DB as "SQLite"
    
    Note over API: Startup: Key Vault
    API ->> DB: Load secrets
    
    Note over B,MSID: Auth Flow
    B ->> MSID: OAuth2 PKCE
    MSID -->> B: JWT token
    B ->> API: GET /api/auth/me
    API ->> MSID: Validate JWT
    MSID -->> API: OK
    API -->> B: User profile
    
    Note over B,DB: Stats CRUD
    B ->> API: PUT stats
    API ->> DB: UPSERT
    DB -->> API: OK
    API -->> B: 200
    
    Note over B,DB: High Scores
    B ->> API: POST highscore
    API ->> DB: INSERT
    DB -->> API: OK
    API -->> B: 201
    
    Note over B,DB: Multiplayer
    B ->> API: POST /queue
    B ->> Lobby: WSS connect
    B ->> MP: SendRealtimeInput
    MP -->> B: RealtimeInput